      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got back from a super long 14 hour flight from singapore to ny and im feeling kinda weird. my right calf is actually pretty sore and sharp if i move it, and im having a bit of a hard time catching my breath like i'm slightly winded even just walking to the kitchen. u think its just travel fatigue or maybe im just dehydrated from the plane?",
