      "content": "omg okay that sounds scary. but honestly i have like zero insurance and an er visit is going to cost me a fortune. plus i feel mostly fine if i just sit still, it's just like a dull ache now. do u think it's really that urgent? maybe i can just drink a ton of water and take some ibuprofen and see if it goes away by tomorrow morning?",
